Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A visitor will be coming to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must not meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you absolutely\Ncannot go to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a visitor for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon this visit and\Ngo back to your cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who plotted everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, John Gloria is\Nmost definitely a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to understand is that\Nyou're being targeted right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from that door now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:01:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum! The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Time, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just get shot? Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's begun his assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was reacting to the air currents\Nin order to predict our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move until we know\Nthe mechanism of the Snipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't order me around\Nlike I'm a stupid child!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,F...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,F-E-40536.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're\Ntalking to, you bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you... Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And be sure not to raise your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It will keep scouting our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria is able to read the\Nflow of air with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It could even be able to react\Nto mild changes in our breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In that stand is his satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His sniping satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where he aims his rifle at the stand,\Nwhich then redirects the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria is in the men's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Nattack him from this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead, we have to\Nsmash his satellite stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because any damage inflicted on the stand\Nis passed through to the user as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But the problem is, when\Nwe move to strike it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the change in the air current\Nwill give him our locations,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'll attack us immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move away from the wall, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actively hunting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sholeen, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a look at my eyes I'm\Ngoing to move on to the right direction
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the\Nnext level I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,To take a look at my eyes,\NI'm going to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way. I'm on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out. We're coming. Yo, I'm on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mad
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly afford to\Nplace my faith in muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When the skin is exposed to the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,muscles become stressed and cause\Nsubtle expansions and contractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,These minor movements are ones\Nthat the body cannot control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I support the rifle with bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The bone embraces the certainty of the\Nground, and the gun unifies with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I place my trust in that stability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteorologists say wind movements are\Nunpredictable, and they have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this fly simply buzzing\Naround aimlessly in space?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This fly is guided by the smell\Nand flow of the air as it flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For the wind is the movement of the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as the guard said,\NJotaro Kujo has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here visiting his\Ndaughter, Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means, two bearers of the Joestar\Nbloodline are in that visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Placing them within range\Nof my downtown transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, Joestar, Joestar, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When I've finally erased your legacy,\Nonly then will my life truly begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I will exact my vengeance for\Nyou robbing me of my heart's support!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You said we needed to take\Nthis thing out, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The droplets are making it move erratically\Nbecause it can't detect the airflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't, ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, look closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dodging the drops\Nof water one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reading the shifts in the\Nair current caused by the drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, get back to the\Nwall before it shoots you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the guards get here, the\Nair will all shift at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, you must listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, you have to move the stone\Nblock at the bottom of the pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit it with all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, just do it. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to make it through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but this hole here between\Nthe walls leads down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps into the prison\Nsewers or through a vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For all we know, it could lead outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't got a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It went away? No, it didn't. It's close.\NIt's merely attempting to determine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the perfect shooting angle you're wrong\Nit went to chase him the boy on the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,other side of this door it's trying\Nto kill the boy who told us about the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,secret passageway Jolene take cover I came\Nhere today to help you get out of this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Place before I came to this room that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,he grabbed my arm as i walked by he did
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,as strange as it may seem\Nhe's here just an ordinary kid
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,like you'd see in the park\NAnd a total stranger to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,for whatever it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, he grabbed me\Nas if he depended on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was strangely soothing, the\Nwarmth of his hand holding my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to defeat Jean Gloria\Nbefore he shoots that poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Check visitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire alarm is coming from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the situation because\Nthere's no car in that room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,where the hell did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And how is he able to\Njust disappear like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's room B!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he dig this hole in this wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have gone in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's height is roughly\Nfour and a half feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's small, like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who he is, but the\Nhole that suddenly opened is a vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell right where it leads\Nby the movement of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I must do everything in my power to\Nprevent that little guy from guiding
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and Jolene to the vent where my\Nbullets have no hope of reaching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not lose sight of them any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shoot down that little brat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, the situation\Nhas gotten too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the stand can only\Nbe used for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try to attack it, it will\Ndetect the change in airflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't allowed to leave visitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the prison sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is hunting for that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But how does he plan to\Nshoot a bullet from the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,men's prison into a utility\Nroom that has no windows?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Hold on. Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That hatch. Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope you're as\Nlucky as you are smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If his entire body is in the\Nwater, there are no air currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially inside the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it already\Nlost sight of him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And there aren't any windows in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But why? And from where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance 321 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet drops 9.5\Ncentimeters in transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wind speed of 3.2 meters from the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This shifts the bullet\N4.2 centimeters left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Target identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Point of aim is locked on his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Those threads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I clearly recognize her stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just jumped out of cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think that will save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shifting point of aim to Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Headshot lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I broke that pipe earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,busted the pipe coming in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered some basic science.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gas is lightweight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so when it accumulates\Naround a given area,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,it can create a completely\Nseparate airflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would put you at a disadvantage\Nreading the air currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do? It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:14:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like Jean Gloria\Ncouldn't read his own luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And how the hell is a little kid like you\Nable to move freely around this prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave this to me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like some kind of bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hand this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me not to go to the visiting\Nroom How do you know so much about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want an answer in time.\NThings will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on to what I\Ngave you no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is that your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I captured Jean Gallier's sniper stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't so tough when\NI had it in my net.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I smashed it to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear you've already grown\Naccustomed to fighting using your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in here! Behind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw him moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide! He has a rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up there behind that pipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He crawled up above that tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He fired from the men's prison, which\Nis two to three hundred meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Add in dozens of steel bars, and the\Nfact that the man is almost blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the world would he have\Nbeen able to get here so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw him in here with us! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the crawlspace above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure enough gas is accumulated by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The coast is clear now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid, where'd he go? Hey, you can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,come out we took care of the bad guy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,come out and tell me what's going on\Nhey what are you doing I'm looking
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,for the kid did you happen to see\Nwhich way the little boy went I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,don't understand what you're asking\Nwho's this boy you're talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.24,0:16:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,there was this kid how could you\Nnot see him in his baseball gear
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that's who I was talking to when\Nwe were in the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean Gloria was even
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to kill this kid\Nfor getting in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:16:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I don't know what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all the way down\Nto this room on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to follow you down. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have heard\Nthe boy's voice at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you\Nwouldn't have heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's the one who told us about\Nthe secret passage in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We talked about it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a ghost talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.24,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything\Nabout secret passageways.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to mess with\Nmy head at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.18,0:17:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here through that secret\Npassageway just like I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about you just seems off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to that\Nbullet wound you had? A wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria shot you\Nin your left shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, your arm isn't bleeding at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My gunshot wound just disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:17:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't Jean Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought he'd been shot in\Nthe head in the visiting room!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No sign of a wound at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What gunshots are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And who the devil is this Jean Gloria?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.06,0:18:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's something even more\Nunfortunate than death will occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you absolutely\Ncannot go to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The visiting room. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was odd right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And that bullet. I'd been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But did any of that really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither myself nor dad are even wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Jean Gloria even attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep things straight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't reality. I\Nmust be hallucinating, or
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,else it's someone else's\Ndoing no way stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream was that all a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but when did I start dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I really did beat up that\Nguard, though I guess that's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a photo of john Gloria that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,same one that dad showed\Nme he told me about
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the accident with the hitchhiker how john
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria set it all up back then that's real
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I got up and\Ntried to leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized\Nmy handcuffs were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're still sitting at this\Ntable, it happened before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't stepped foot out of the\Nvisiting room since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind made it all up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean Gallier's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And all that bullshit about air currents?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret passageway and what followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,From the moment we stepped into this\Nvisitation room, we fell into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've been hallucinating ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly but surely, as if we were\Nsitting in a huge snake's stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we were melting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy hiding in the trash\Ncan who gave me this bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke up from this nightmare\Nbecause I hurt my hand on this bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Without this sharp pain, I would\Nhave stayed asleep and died!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This power of illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be Zhang Kali's actual stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired, but I can't go to sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to escape from this goddamn room!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place Other than he
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.42,0:23:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
